Meta.DisplayName=NightCoop Hub (AMP 3)
Meta.Description=Meeting point and relay for NightCoop, the co-op mod for Cyberpunk 2077. Hosts no game: the world stays on the host player's save, the hub hands out session codes and relays traffic.
Meta.OS=Linux
Meta.AarchSupport=Supported
Meta.Arch=All
Meta.Author=Hermes
Meta.URL=https://nightcoop.net/
Meta.DisplayImageSource=https://nightcoop.net/media/poster-020-1280.jpg
